    "body": "Should we throw DataCloneError when we encounter OOB case?\r\nWhile detached buffer cannot be recovered again, OOB case can be recovered later.\r\n\r\nFor example,\r\n```javascript\r\nvar arrayBuffer = new ArrayBuffer(1024, { maxByteLength: 4096 });\r\nvar view = new Int8Array(arrayBuffer, 0, 1024);\r\narrayBuffer.resize(0);\r\n\r\n// Even though view is right now OOB status, it can be recovered compared to the detached case.\r\nvar clonedView = structuredClone(view);\r\nclonedView.buffer.resize(1024);\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2022-11-29T03:44:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-11-29T03:44:57Z",
