    "body": "Yeah, I don't have strong feelings too. Just I would like to have a rationale behind this decision.\r\nAnd probably,\r\n> because in normal JS code you cannot have OOB TypedArrays at creation time.\r\n\r\nis good. And if this model does not fit in the real world usage, then we can extend it later.",
